# Contents which do not fit: the bars of the main window and the pulldown
# menus are clipped and show markers, never a scroll bar.
#
#  b1: in a narrow window the menu bar, the main bar and the mode bar are
#      cut off and each carries a marker at its right end, a chevron over a
#      strip of the bar fading over the buttons; the focus bar still fits
#  b2: a wheel turned over the main bar scrolls it sideways (a mouse has no
#      horizontal wheel), so its end shows and the marker moves to the left
#  b3: a click on the marker of the mode bar brings the next screenful in
#  m1: a menu taller than the window is shifted up to fit inside it and
#      carries a marker at the bottom; nothing is drawn outside the window
#  m2: the wheel scrolls the menu; the marker moves to the top
wait 6000
window #2
wait 500
resize 520 380
wait 900
snapshot b1
move 250 52
wait 200
wheel 250 52 0 -4
wait 600
snapshot b2
click 505 90
wait 600
snapshot b3
resize 560 300
wait 900
click 38 12
wait 900
snapshot m1
wheel 60 150 0 -5
wait 600
snapshot m2
